# BuildKit prefers "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" over the context-root
# .dockerignore for a given Dockerfile. This image only ever COPYs 7 small
# manifest/script files (see the Dockerfile) — everything else in the repo,
# including 1.7GB of GGUF models under server/agent/models and every
# node_modules/venv tree, is dead weight shipped across virtiofs on every
# build. Allowlist instead of denylist since the needed set is so small.
*
!server/requirements.txt
!client/package.json
!client/package-lock.json
!client/tellus/package.json
!client/tellus/package-lock.json
!client/oceanlab/package.json
!client/oceanlab/package-lock.json
!docker/agent-sandbox/entrypoint.sh
!scripts/msandbox/container/msandbox-host-client
